==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|pulmōnārius|t=of the lungs}}, from {{m|la|pulmō|t=lung}} + {{m|la|-ārius}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*pléu-mon-}}. Cognate with {{cog|el|πνευμόνι|πλεμόνι}}, {{cog|fr|poumon}}, {{cog|lt|plauciai}}, {{cog|pl|płuco}} and {{cog|ru|пла́вать|t=to swim}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} Pertaining to, having, or affecting the [[lung]]s.

